OL,4,CCouncil investigating 80 fly-tipped    
OL,5,Cbonfires                               
OL,6,GDumped sofas, cabinets and mattresses  
OL,7,Gwere used to build fires in a town     
OL,8,Gahead of Bonfire Night.                
OL,10,FMiddlesbrough Council is investigating 
OL,11,Fmore than 80 instances of such waste   
OL,12,Fbeing used to make bonfires.           
OL,14,FIt said it was using CCTV footage to   
OL,15,Ftrack vans, cars and trucks, often     
OL,16,Fbearing company logos, seen dumping    
OL,17,Fthe waste as part of Bonfire Night     
OL,18,Fclean-up efforts.                      
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
