OL,4,CBirders flock to shopping park to see  
OL,5,Cwaxwings                               
OL,6,GBirdwatchers have been gathering at a  
OL,7,Gretail park to see a flock of birds    
OL,8,Gwhich do not breed in the UK.          
OL,10,FWaxwings are most commonly found in    
OL,11,Fthe forests of Scandinavia and Western 
OL,12,FRussia and migrate to the UK in the    
OL,13,Fwinter in search of berries, their     
OL,14,Ffavourite food.                        
OL,16,FBut a flock of about 30 has been       
OL,17,Fspotted at the Albion Retail Park in   
OL,18,FBlyth, Northumberland, this week, with 
OL,19,Fbirders travelling miles to catch a    
OL,20,Fglimpse.                               
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
